cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file,
  and cite the accompanying paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
title: >-
  eigenvalues-plane-matlab: Discrete sine transform based discretisation of the
  Dirichlet Laplacian on two-dimensional domains
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of a discrete sine transform (DST) based discretisation
  of the Laplace operator with homogeneous Dirichlet boundary conditions on
  generic two-dimensional domains. A domain is embedded in a rectangular
  bounding box sampled on a uniform grid, the interior is selected by an
  indicator function, and the DST based second derivative is applied to every
  contiguous interior chunk of each grid row and column. Finite-difference,
  finite-element and Chebyshev implementations are included for comparison.
